#: ../../source/docs/common-analog-pins.rst:5 1439b12a2701489c8ef520d7171722e2
msgid "Analog Input Pins"
msgstr "模拟输入引脚"

#: ../../source/docs/common-analog-pins.rst:7 cb688b7be1084321b0358a6e52b75a53
msgid ""
"In addition to digital input and output pins, autopilots have analog input "
"pins that allow measuring voltages precisely. These are commonly used for "
"the power monitor voltge and current sense inputs, but other pins are "
"sometimes provided for:"
msgstr "除数字输入输出引脚外，飞控还具有可精确测量电压的模拟输入引脚。这些引脚通常用于电源监测器的电压和电流采样输入，但有时也提供其他引脚用于："

#: ../../source/docs/common-analog-pins.rst:9 c915ac767c6542beac2ccbff207f6f4e
msgid "RSSI (Received Signal Strength Input)"
msgstr "RSSI（接收信号强度输入）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-analog-pins.rst:10
#: 95a3f7d40f8b44249e6389cfdc2bc9a2
msgid "Analog Airspeed Sensor Input"
msgstr "模拟空速传感器输入"

#: ../../source/docs/common-analog-pins.rst:11
#: 003e0a5bd5ae4a30ab07328269ad337b
msgid "Analog Fuel Level Sensor Input"
msgstr "模拟油量传感器输入"

#: ../../source/docs/common-analog-pins.rst:12
#: 30f8aaca4bd04c4c84a95aecd01002fb
msgid "Analog Sonar/Rangefinder Input"
msgstr "模拟声纳/测距仪输入"

#: ../../source/docs/common-analog-pins.rst:13
#: 8f341203e0fb4e67b2974afd459c0a14
msgid "Analog Temperature Sensor Input"
msgstr "模拟温度传感器输入"

#: ../../source/docs/common-analog-pins.rst:15
#: d02e557436ee4ddfba61cc85ba3bdcc5
msgid ""
"all pins can accept 0-3.3v inputs. Unless the documentation (OEM or Wiki) "
"specifically specifies 6.6V input range, only apply 3.3 maximum!"
msgstr "所有引脚可接受 0-3.3V 输入。除非文档（OEM 或 Wiki）明确说明支持 6.6V 输入范围，否则最高只能施加 3.3V！"

#: ../../source/docs/common-analog-pins.rst:17
#: f995c7771a2a4ea980dbd5563640d5d2
msgid ""
"When any of these inputs are enabled by the appropriate sensor type "
"selection, a ``_PIN`` parameter will need to be entered to designate which "
"\"pin\" on the autopilot is to be used. Often, the correct pin number for "
"the autopilot's analog inputs will be documented either on its Wiki page "
"here, or the OEM's documentation."
msgstr ""
"当通过适当的传感器类型选择启用这些输入时，需要填写 ``_PIN`` 参数以指定飞控上使用的「引脚」。飞控模拟输入的正确引脚编号通常记录在此处的 "
"Wiki 页面或 OEM 文档中。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-analog-pins.rst:19
#: e71e9347852c432995be62bcca88df20
msgid ""
"If not, then examining the autopilot's ``hwdef.dat`` file `here "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/tree/master/libraries/AP_HAL_ChibiOS/hwdef>`__"
" can provide the information. The process is a bit difficult but manageable."
msgstr ""
"如果没有，可以查看飞控的 ``hwdef.dat`` 文件（`参见此处 "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/tree/master/libraries/AP_HAL_ChibiOS/hwdef>`__）获取相关信息。该过程较为繁琐，但可以完成。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-analog-pins.rst:21
#: f3ce252351de41b2995fa21a63154b03
msgid ""
"For example, the `CUAV-X7 autopilot hwdef.dat "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/libraries/AP_HAL_ChibiOS/hwdef/CUAV-X7/hwdef.dat>`__"
" has a section designating its internal A-to-D converters:"
msgstr ""
"例如，`CUAV-X7 飞控 hwdef.dat "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/libraries/AP_HAL_ChibiOS/hwdef/CUAV-X7/hwdef.dat>`__"
" 中有一个指定其内部模数转换器的部分："

#: ../../source/docs/common-analog-pins.rst:44
#: 29b25050518847d394a49917dced415e
msgid ""
"The last three lines define inputs used internally on the board to monitor "
"various board supply voltages. The first two lines define the voltage and "
"current sense inputs, the next define user analog inputs and the RSSI input."
" In order to determine which pins numbers are used in ArduPilot parameters, "
"one more lookup step is required:"
msgstr ""
"最后三行定义了板载用于监测各路板载电源电压的内部输入。前两行定义电压和电流采样输入，接下来定义用户模拟输入和 RSSI 输入。为了确定 "
"ArduPilot 参数中使用的引脚编号，还需要一个查找步骤："

#: ../../source/docs/common-analog-pins.rst:46
#: 38ea14d6bd3943f093418d610a6c36ab
msgid ""
"After determining which cpu is used in the autopilot, the pin numbers "
"corresponding to the cpu pins can be determined from the `cpu's definition "
"table here "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/tree/master/libraries/AP_HAL_ChibiOS/hwdef/scripts>`__."
" In the above example, the cpu is STM32H743, and looking at the bottom of "
"its `definition file "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/libraries/AP_HAL_ChibiOS/hwdef/scripts/STM32H743xx.py>`__,"
" you can find its cpu to ardupilot pin tables:"
msgstr ""
"确定飞控使用的 CPU 后，可以从 `CPU "
"定义表（此处）<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/tree/master/libraries/AP_HAL_ChibiOS/hwdef/scripts>`__"
" 查找 CPU 引脚对应的引脚编号。在上述示例中，CPU 为 STM32H743，查看其 `定义文件 "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/libraries/AP_HAL_ChibiOS/hwdef/scripts/STM32H743xx.py>`__"
" 底部，可以找到其 CPU 到 ArduPilot 的引脚对应表："

#: ../../source/docs/common-analog-pins.rst:73
#: 0fd796ef774a4c6995b51f10e29934ea
msgid ""
"and for ADC1, the power monitor voltage input, PA0, would be ArduPilot pin "
"\"16\", the RSSI input, PF12, would correspond to ArduPilot pin \"6\", etc. "
"and these pin values would be used in the appropriate ``_PIN`` parameter."
msgstr ""
"对于 ADC1，电源监测器电压输入 PA0 对应 ArduPilot 引脚 「16」，RSSI 输入 PF12 对应 ArduPilot 引脚 "
"「6」，依此类推，这些引脚值将用于相应的 ``_PIN`` 参数。"
